Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:02.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(605.7,111.2)}派大星
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.55,0:00:02.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,﻿捉水母安全小贴士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:02.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jellyfishing safety tips
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.79,0:00:03.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,规则一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.79,0:00:03.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rule number one--
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.82,0:00:06.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,捉水母时千万不要喂水母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.82,0:00:06.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,never try to feed the jellyfish while jellyfishing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.86,0:00:07.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:07.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want some?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.03,0:00:11.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,规则二
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:11.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Rule number two--
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.43,0:00:15.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,千千万万不要捉小水母宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.43,0:00:15.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never, ever try to capture a baby jellyfish
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.03,0:00:16.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可它们好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.03,0:00:16.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But they‘re so cute
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.10,0:00:19.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好啊  水母妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:19.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey there, mama jellyfish
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.00,0:00:23.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就引出了最后一条规则
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:23.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Which brings us to our final rule--
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.04,0:00:24.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要带一大支
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:24.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,always carry a thick tube
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.67,0:00:26.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应急用的水母蜇伤药膏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:26.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of emergency jellyfish sting ointment
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.78,0:00:28.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得我可能需要那个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:28.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I might need that
